            "text": "SQL Injection / Search Parameter — No issue identified: GET /api/products (q parameter)\n\nTested with SQL injection payloads ' OR '1'='1 and ' OR 1=1 --. The /api/products endpoint returns empty results for injection payloads, suggesting parameterized queries or proper input validation. Unlike /rest/products/search, this endpoint is not vulnerable to SQL injection."
          },
